      "side": 1,
      "message": "So if we don\u0027t have the ability to check if flash is erased then we effectively lose any ability to recover from a failed dfu update, the system will potentially not be recoverable. It\u0027ll be worthwhile to figure out if we can do this check.\n\nIt\u0027s not perfect but reading a few bytes chunk starting at CONFIG_RW_MEM_OFF and doing a memcmp against CONFIG_FLASH_ERASED_VALUE32 would be sufficient if we can\u0027t rely on the core library.",
