      "writtenOn": "2023-01-25T01:22:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually it probably matters a lot less unless we do partial DFU updates and the checksum check option could address it too. Realize you\u0027re probably not using the servo-dfu flow described so some of the protections are reduced.",
      "parentUuid": "99e38850_c6f29026",
